# CI and release workflows

Read the workflow being changed, root `package.json`, and `docs/PROJECT_FACTS.md` for current commands.

- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and `.gitlab-ci.yml` share verification scripts but are not identical deployment pipelines. Update both when a shared check changes; do not copy GitHub release jobs into GitLab automatically.
- Derive branch/tag triggers and job dependencies from executable YAML. Commented-out checks are not running gates.
- Keep reusable build logic in scripts where practical. Preserve secret handling and avoid printing decoded production configuration.
- Release artifacts, updater metadata, macOS signing, and apt publication have distinct gates. Read `docs/MACOS_SIGNING.md` and `docs/apt-repository.md` when touching those paths.
- Validate the affected YAML/scripts; state which hosted jobs or platform builds were not executed locally.
